silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_06_dependency_governance_sections_01_dependency_as_typed_arrow_concrete_anchor_6 silm:hasExample "In 'ConcreteAnchor — 01_dependency_as_typed_arrow #6', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, In section 'Dependency as Typed Arrow' the bare symbol VetRecord anchors to MittensVetRecordDependsOnCitationKey: The dependency arrow: the published claim depends on the citation key, which depends on the source-boundary declaration; reversing this would create a cycle and break acyclicity.." .
